---Function: int main
------CompoundStmt:
---------Decl: int x
------------ConstantExpr: 2
---------Decl: int result
------------ConstantExpr: 0
---------SwitchStmt
------------IdentExpr: x
------------CaseStmt
---------------ConstantExpr: 1
---------------AssignStmt: result
------------------ConstantExpr: 10
---------------BreakStmt
------------CaseStmt
---------------ConstantExpr: 2
---------------AssignStmt: result
------------------ConstantExpr: 20
